Kompas studio photo v1. Editorial visual review approved.
Original SHA-256: 5b688a266625730e64cf8893ce9a424f8d542a95ca9330aee9ad56d62b576824
A realistic work table with one finished and one partly built paper-folding exercise, alongside two short pencil stubs. Natural evidence of different ways to practice. Make one original ultra-realistic live editorial studio photograph for the independent magazine Kompas. Wide landscape about 1.9:1, central subject inside the middle 75% for a consistent crop; clear plausible optics and readable shadow detail. Real controlled directional daylight, neutral-warm color, tactile ordinary materials, one purposeful subject and an interesting but restrained sense of depth. Photographic, no layout or decorative graphics. No people, faces, hands, silhouettes, visible lettering, numbers, logos, neon, fake interface or watermarks.
